[
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_445.bf.json:0:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞公告板上贴着一张笔记本残页……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_445.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞笔记本残页上写着\n　{F2 01 03 01}“又几又”{F2 01 01 01}。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_445.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2A 06}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}咦，这个形状……\n和刚才发现的笔记本残页\n十分相似。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_445.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}又是莫名其妙的暗号啊。\n不过多了一个“又”字。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_445.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 09 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4E 0A}和刚才看到的暗号很像。\n我想应该有关联……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_445.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}而且纸页上下都被撕掉了。\n这可能是中间的部分。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_445.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A1 11}这里也用胶水粘住了。\n想完整地揭下来很难呢……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_445.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不如记下来吧？\n这样随时都能查看。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_445.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 86 13 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这样就齐了吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_445.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}最先找到的“上半张”，\n后来找到的“下半张”，\n还有现在找到的“中间那张”……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_445.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3C 06}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}……应该是这样没错。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_445.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}接下来只要推理出\n这些线索指的是什么就好了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_445.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞上下都有撕裂的痕迹。\n　难道是某张纸页的中间部分……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
]